      "releaseNotes": "Subwhere is now four cities in one app: London, Paris, Stockholm and Tokyo, all included. \n\n• Switch cities whenever you like. Each city downloads the first time you open it. \n• Stockholm is still here: open it once after the update to download it. Your widgets keep working in the meantime. \n• Now in English, French, Swedish and Japanese. \n• A new icon.",
